  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879486",
      "title": "Example: Animating a Modal",
      "lectureOrder": 201,
      "videoOrder": 176,
      "sourceHash": "d41cd72259cb40cc71e3b27e9936b99e92544bd711b11afbaa6ab3889a71c6f3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 5.57,
          "en": "So let's now apply what we learned about transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.57,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "about this transition component, to our modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 12.105,
          "en": "Because that was the thing where I explained",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.105,
          "end": 15.44,
          "en": "that we might need more help from vue's side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.44,
          "end": 18.77,
          "en": "Especially for having a transition and animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.77,
          "end": 20.42,
          "en": "when we close it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.42,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "Now we can wrap transition around our own custom components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "just as we can wrap it around built-in elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.41,
          "end": 30.94,
          "en": "So we can use transition here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.94,
          "end": 33.683,
          "en": "around our base-model, just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.58,
          "end": 37.21,
          "en": "Now we can, of course also set the name prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.21,
          "end": 40.09,
          "en": "to define our own prefix for all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.09,
          "end": 42.53,
          "en": "those special classes you will add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.53,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "And I will add modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 47.193,
          "en": "But again, you can pick any name you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.26,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "And then we can dig into our CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "and start to finding those CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 59.38,
          "en": "And here I'll add a modal-enter-from class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.38,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "a modal-enter-active class and a modal-enter-to class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.87,
          "end": 70.99,
          "en": "And I will actually go to BaseModal.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.99,
          "end": 73.12,
          "en": "and make sure that I removed the animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.12,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "from the modal there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.72,
          "en": "So that we don't see this animation anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.72,
          "end": 80.093,
          "en": "So make sure you comment as out or remove this line.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.22,
          "end": 83.09,
          "en": "And then let's go back to App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.09,
          "end": 85.3,
          "en": "which is where we're using the base-model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.3,
          "end": 87.89,
          "en": "and where we are wrapping it with transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.89,
          "end": 91.18,
          "en": "And now we can define our different styles here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.18,
          "end": 93.07,
          "en": "And it's now of course, totally up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.07,
          "end": 95.8,
          "en": "how you want to animate this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.8,
          "end": 99.363,
          "en": "I will actually bring over my modal keyframes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.023,
          "en": "So the keyframes from the BaseModal.vue file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.95,
          "end": 109.43,
          "en": "add them here, to App.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.43,
          "end": 111.67,
          "en": "You can have multiple sets of keyframes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.67,
          "end": 114.08,
          "en": "in the same style tax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.08,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "as long as you're using different names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 118.66,
          "en": "And I actually don't even need to enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.66,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "from an enter-to now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "We just need enter-active to play at animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.82,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "and this will be the modal animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 127.603,
          "en": "which i just copied over,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.56,
          "end": 131.723,
          "en": "give it a duration and a ease-in function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.8,
          "end": 135.5,
          "en": "And if we do that, we'll notice a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.5,
          "end": 139.223,
          "en": "If we reload, this modal has no animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.49,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "Now, this transition component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 147.98,
          "en": "does work on custom components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.98,
          "end": 149.81,
          "en": "But we have a problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.81,
          "end": 153.57,
          "en": "The classes vue wants to add are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.57,
          "end": 156.71,
          "en": "to the root element of your custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.71,
          "end": 159.55,
          "en": "This is ,this attribute fall through behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.55,
          "end": 161.023,
          "en": "I talked about earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.7,
          "end": 165.28,
          "en": "So these classes transition wants to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.28,
          "end": 167.98,
          "en": "fall through to the root element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.98,
          "end": 170.15,
          "en": "in the template of base-model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.15,
          "end": 174.013,
          "en": "But base-model happens to have two root elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.013,
          "end": 177.23,
          "en": "There's div and there's dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.23,
          "end": 180.04,
          "en": "If we comment out the div for a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.04,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "if we remove that div, the backdrop for a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 186.23,
          "en": "and then reload, you see, it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.23,
          "end": 190.79,
          "en": "Now we have this animation for showing the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.79,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "But if we have both root elements here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 196.82,
          "en": "which you of course want, then this does not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.82,
          "end": 199.886,
          "en": "And it doesn't work because as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.886,
          "end": 204.886,
          "en": "this transition component wants one direct child element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.4,
          "en": "Yes, it has just one child element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 211.41,
          "en": "just one base-model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 213.4,
          "en": "But of course the base-model here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.4,
          "end": 216.52,
          "en": "is really just a wrapper around its template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.52,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "where we have two root elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 223.79,
          "en": "So these two root elements, this div and this dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.79,
          "end": 227.11,
          "en": "these are the actual direct child elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.11,
          "end": 229.62,
          "en": "inside of this transition component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.62,
          "end": 232.3,
          "en": "Well, and two elements are more than one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.3,
          "end": 236.34300000000002,
          "en": "That's why this set-up here does not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.62,
          "end": 239.1,
          "en": "What can we do about that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.1,
          "end": 241.26,
          "en": "How can we work around that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.26,
          "end": 243.91,
          "en": "Well, there are various ways of solving this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.91,
          "end": 247.33,
          "en": "We can, for example, split this into two components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.33,
          "end": 250.06,
          "en": "and manage the backdrop separately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.06,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "But we could also bring this transition component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "over to base-model and try using it in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 258.61,
          "en": "to transition to style log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.61,
          "end": 260.63,
          "en": "And that's the route I will take here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.63,
          "end": 262.356,
          "en": "I'll remove the transition wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.356,
          "end": 264.423,
          "en": "around my custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "Though it theoretically would work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 270.89,
          "en": "if our custom component had just one root element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.89,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "but here it doesn't, so it doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 276.06,
          "en": "And I will bring it over to base-model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.06,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "and wrap this dialogue with transition, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.57,
          "end": 284.972,
          "en": "Now I can give this a name of, modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 284.972,
          "end": 286.8,
          "en": "and go back to App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.8,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "and grab my modal specific CSS classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 293.67,
          "en": "to be precise to modal-enter-active class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.67,
          "end": 296.17,
          "en": "we can remove them from App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.17,
          "end": 299.33,
          "en": "remove the modal keyframes from App.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 299.33,
          "end": 302.26,
          "en": "and bring all of that over to BaseModal.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.26,
          "end": 304.65,
          "en": "There, we already got the modal keyframes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 307.63,
          "en": "and now I'm also adding the modal-enter-active class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 307.63,
          "end": 309.67,
          "en": "which points at the modal keyframes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.67,
          "end": 311.423,
          "en": "to play it as an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.18,
          "end": 315.45,
          "en": "Now, however, we need to change the logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.45,
          "end": 318.02,
          "en": "how this base-model opens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.02,
          "end": 320.91,
          "en": "At the moment, I'm adding the base-model component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.91,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "in App.vue with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 327.54,
          "en": "And this won't work, if I want to use transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.54,
          "end": 329.59,
          "en": "inside of the base-model template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 329.59,
          "end": 332.95,
          "en": "to animate the addition and remove of dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.95,
          "end": 335.75,
          "en": "If transition is part of that template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.75,
          "end": 337.88,
          "en": "which has added and removed with v-if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.88,
          "end": 339.563,
          "en": "it won't have any effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 343.92,
          "en": "Therefore I'll now open and close the modal differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 343.92,
          "end": 348.92,
          "en": "I'll add a new open prop, to my base-model component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.11,
          "end": 351.85,
          "en": "and point at dialogue is visible there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 351.85,
          "end": 355.55,
          "en": "So forward, the dialogue is visible property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 355.55,
          "end": 359.453,
          "en": "through the open prop to the base-model component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 361.14,
          "end": 363.76,
          "en": "And now in the base-model component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 363.76,
          "end": 367.09,
          "en": "we can accept this prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.09,
          "end": 369.753,
          "en": "So expect the open prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 369.753,
          "end": 372.37,
          "en": "And now that we're getting it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.37,
          "end": 376.51,
          "en": "we can simply add it here with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 376.51,
          "end": 379.15,
          "en": "We can check open, so does open prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.15,
          "end": 382.03,
          "en": "which is true or false, to control whether or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.03,
          "end": 383.783,
          "en": "the dialogue is visible or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.86,
          "end": 388.7,
          "en": "So now the base-model component is always added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 388.7,
          "end": 390.6,
          "en": "to the App.vue template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 390.6,
          "end": 393.11,
          "en": "but inside of that base-model template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 393.11,
          "end": 396.24,
          "en": "the dialogue is still controlled with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 396.24,
          "end": 398.23,
          "en": "But now it's wrapped in a transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 398.23,
          "end": 401.763,
          "en": "and now this transition has only one direct child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 403.03,
          "end": 406.3,
          "en": "And of course, we also want to add v-if here to the div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 406.3,
          "end": 409.68,
          "en": "and pass the open prop to v-if as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 409.68,
          "end": 412.113,
          "en": "to control the visibility of the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 413.76,
          "end": 417.75,
